  "difficulty": "advanced",
  "title": {
    "zh": "峰谷双层取样架",
    "en": "Peaks and Troughs Gallery"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "严格极值、上下货架、限步采样",
    "en": "Strict extrema, split shelves and a tight route"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "从左到右，七个检修口对应 scan() 的七个读数，每口间隔两格。某读数严格高于两旁就取上架件，严格低于两旁就取下架件，两端跳过。按工位从左到右提交被选读数，所有值要从同一个列表读取。停在最右出口；回合只够进出所需货架。",
    "en": "Seven bays, two tiles apart, match the seven scan() readings from left to right. Collect an upper part at each strict peak and a lower part at each strict trough; skip the endpoints. Submit the selected readings in left-to-right bay order, all from the same list. Finish at the far-right exit. The turn budget covers only the required shelf visits."
  },
